 "_why": "G4 ATTACK REDUCTION pairs a candidate against policy@vN 'on the same training slice'. The slice is 50 instances; a single campaign round records 6. This record says which fifty episodes exist, when they were driven, against which target, and under which locks - so a b/c figure can be checked by somebody who was not here.",
